# The stale-tagger cross-mode bug, with a runner to actually find
#
# 12 sets up the precondition -- is_tagger surviving a switch to Lives -- but
# with one kart HandleTagAndGoTagTransfer's `runners` query is empty, so the
# find_if predicate never runs and the bad cast is never reached. Reverting the
# fix leaves 12 green. This script adds the second kart and parks it on top of
# the first, so the predicate runs and the tag would transfer.
#
# The assertion is that it does NOT: in Lives mode the transfer system must
# return before it touches RoundTagAndGoSettings at all.
#
# Two players rather than a bot: a player kart with no input is stationary, so
# where the two karts are is decided entirely by warp_car.
#
# No screenshots: karts are live and moving.

disable_animations

set_round_type Lives
goto_screen Main
wait 0.2

add_player 1
wait_frames 3
expect_car_count 2

start_round
wait_frames 3
expect_state Playing

# After start_round: reset_car_trackers clears is_tagger on every kart, so the
# stale flag has to be planted on this side of it.
set_tracker_at 0 is_tagger 1
set_tracker_at 1 is_tagger 0
expect_tracker_at 0 is_tagger 1
expect_tracker_at 1 is_tagger 0

# raylib::GetTime() is 0 under --headless, and reset_temp_data leaves
# last_tag_time at -1, so "now - last_tag_time" is 1 against a 2s cooldown and
# the transfer would decline for the wrong reason. Backdate the runner so the
# only thing left that can stop it is the guard under test.
set_tracker_at 1 last_tag_time -100

# Same point, so CheckCollisionRecs is true. Collision resolution starts
# pushing them apart immediately, which is why the assertion is two frames
# later and not twenty.
warp_car 0 640 360
warp_car 1 640 360
wait_frames 2

# The tag has not moved, because the transfer system is not allowed to run
# outside TagAndGo. Without the guard car 1 is the tagger by now.
expect_tracker_at 0 is_tagger 1
expect_tracker_at 1 is_tagger 0

# ...and the Lives round is unharmed by the near miss.
expect_state Playing
expect_tracker_at 0 lives 1
expect_tracker_at 1 lives 1

end_round
wait_frames 3
expect_state Menu

remove_player 1
wait_frames 3
expect_car_count 1
goto_screen Main
wait 0.2
